## Database Schema

```
User
├── id (PK, Integer)
├── name (String 100)
├── email (String 120, unique, indexed)
├── password_hash (String 256)
└── created_at (DateTime)

SavedRecipe
├── id (PK, Integer)
├── user_id (FK → user.id, indexed)
├── food_name (String 200)
├── ingredients (Text, JSON)
├── recipe_steps (Text, JSON)
├── image_path (String 500)
├── prediction_source (String 100)
├── confidence (Float)
├── cooking_time (String 50)
├── servings (String 50)
├── created_at (DateTime)
└── UNIQUE(user_id, food_name, image_path)
```

